# TR House Telvanni: "On Elemental Daedra" (TR_m1_HT_Rathra_q1), Mistress Rathra's first chore, open once "Plague"
# (TR_m1_HT_Ra2) is done. In her chambers in Tel Ouada, "chores" adds the book's topic; asking it ("Continue" 1)
# warns of the feud with Mithras and logs 10 (TR_m1_HT_RathraVMithras 100); handing over the book ("I have it right
# here." 2) pays out (100) and starts TR_m1_Q_HT_RathraVMithras_sc.
# PositionCell stands in for the travel; the AddItem for the player buying the book from a bookseller.
# Run: python -m tools.live.test_instance mwtest --cases <this folder> --fast --checkpoints --stop-on-fail --load mwtest_ht_ra2_done --timeout 3600
# See docs/commentary/headless_testing.md#quest-runs

case ht_rathra_q1_start
run
player->PositionCell 4123 3980 14430 0 "Tel Ouada, Tower: Rathra's Chambers"
until 600 "TR_m1_T_Rathra"->GetDistance player < 800
wait 120
talk TR_m1_T_Rathra
ask chores
ask On Elemental Daedra
choose 1
expect GetJournalIndex TR_m1_HT_Rathra_q1 == 10
bye
end

case ht_rathra_q1_book
run
player->AddItem "T_Bk_ElementalDaedraTR" 1
talk TR_m1_T_Rathra
ask On Elemental Daedra
choose 2
expect GetJournalIndex TR_m1_HT_Rathra_q1 == 100
bye
end
